# A journal written by running the CLI without AGENT_JOURNAL_ROOT set: it
# defaults to the working directory, so any dev invocation from inside the
# package writes a real journal here. One reached a commit this way, carrying
# the machine hostname in its segment path — and scripts/verify-skills.mjs did
# not catch it, because .jsonl is not among the extensions it scans.
packages/agent-journal/workspaces/
